Local patch for apple/coreai-models 0.2.0 (938d0b8), applied by scripts/bootstrap.sh to a fresh clone.
1. Xcode 27.0 (27A266a): LanguageModelCapabilities(capabilities:) became LanguageModelCapabilities(_:).
   Same change as upstream 5ed9981 (#123), which no 0.2.x tag carries (apple/coreai-models#293).
2. xgrammar: branch main -> exact 0.2.9 (main on 2026-11-07), so every clone resolves the same version.

diff --git a/Package.swift b/Package.swift
